sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant D as Codex 设计体 (1492b1f6)
    participant B as Bridge 事件入口
    participant S as StateStore (引擎账本)
    participant C as CommDB (通信名册)
    participant L as Lead close-tmux
    participant P as Lead 巡检

    D->>B: complete --route phase_design_complete
    B->>S: sessions.status = completed, node = done
    Note over C: 行仍 running + keep_alive=1 (按合同: 体活着停驻)
    D->>C: 声明 parked "design complete, awaiting design wake"
    L->>B: POST close-tmux (StateStore=completed, 守卫放行)
    B->>B: 收 daemon (absent) + kill-window @2998
    B->>S: 事件 tmux_closed
    Note over C: 没有任何写入: 行仍 running, ended_at 空
    loop 每个巡检 tick
        P->>C: owner index: status IN (running, blocked)
        P->>P: 有目标、无 pane => MISSING_PANE
    end
